                  <SHORT-NAME>GptDeinitApi</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">
                    &lt;html&gt;
                      Adds / removes the service Gpt_DeInit() from the code.
                    &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
