                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                         value=&quot;EN: This container contains a parameter, which represents a reference to a container of the type McuClockReferencePoint (defined in module MCU).&quot;/&gt;
                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
